	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24.000000','Bison-exception-2.2','Bison exception 2.2','http://git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/bison.git/tree/data/yacc.c?id=193d7c7054ba7197b0789e14965b739162319b5e#n141',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'Bison Exception

As a special exception, you may create a larger work that contains part or all of the Bison parser skeleton and distribute that work under terms of your choice, so long as that work isn''t itself a parser generator using the skeleton or a modified version thereof as a parser skeleton. Alternatively, if you modify or redistribute the parser skeleton itself, you may (at your option) remove this special exception, which will cause the skeleton and the resulting Bison output files to be licensed under the GNU General Public License without this special exception.

This special exception was added by the Free Software Foundation in version 2.2 of Bison.','野牛例外

作为特殊例外，您可以创建包含部分或全部Bison解析器框架的较大工作，并根据您选择的条款分发该工作，只要该工作本身不是使用该框架或其修改版本作为解析器框架的解析器生成器。或者，如果您修改或重新分发解析器框架本身，您可以(根据您的选择)删除此特殊例外，这将导致框架和生成的Bison输出文件在GNU通用公共许可证下获得许可，而不会有此特殊例外。

这个特殊的例外是由自由软件基金会在Bison的2.2版中添加的。','Typically used with GPL-2.0 or GPL-3.0'),
	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24.000000','Linux-syscall-note','Linux Syscall Note','https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/tree/COPYING',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'NOTE! This copyright does *not* cover user programs that use kernel
 services by normal system calls - this is merely considered normal use
 of the kernel, and does *not* fall under the heading of "derived work".
 Also note that the GPL below is copyrighted by the Free Software
 Foundation, but the instance of code that it refers to (the Linux
 kernel) is copyrighted by me and others who actually wrote it.

 Also note that the only valid version of the GPL as far as the kernel
 is concerned is _this_ particular version of the license (ie v2, not
 v2.2 or v3.x or whatever), unless explicitly otherwise stated.

			Linus Torvalds','注意！本版权不包括使用内核的用户程序
由正常系统调用提供的服务-这仅被视为正常使用
并不属于“派生工作”的标题。
还请注意，下面的GPL受自由软件的版权保护
基础，而是它所引用的代码实例(Linux
内核)的版权归我和其他实际编写它的人所有。

还请注意，就内核而言，GPL的唯一有效版本
涉及的是该许可证的特定版本(即v2，而不是
V2.2或v3.x或其他版本)，除非另有明确说明。

莱纳斯·托瓦尔兹','This note is used with the Linux kernel to clarify how user space API files should be treated.'),
	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24.000000','Font-exception-2.0','Font exception 2.0','http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-faq.html#FontException',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'As a special exception, if you create a document which uses this font, and embed this font or unaltered portions of this font into the document, this font does not by itself cause the resulting document to be covered by the GNU General Public License. This exception does not however invalidate any other reasons why the document might be covered by the GNU General Public License. If you modify this font, you may extend this exception to your version of the font, but you are not obligated to do so. If you do not wish to do so, delete this exception statement from your version.','作为特殊例外，如果您创建了使用此字体的文档，并将此字体或此字体的未更改部分嵌入到文档中，则此字体本身不会导致生成的文档受GNU通用公共许可证的保护。但是，这一例外不会使GNU通用公共许可证可能涵盖该文档的任何其他原因无效。如果您修改此字体，您可以将此例外扩展到您的字体版本，但您没有义务这样做。如果您不希望这样做，请从您的版本中删除此例外声明。','Typically used with GPL-2.0'),
	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24.000000','GPL-CC-1.0','GPL Cooperation Commitment 1.0','https://github.com/gplcc/gplcc/blob/master/Project/COMMITMENT,https://gplcc.github.io/gplcc/Project/README-PROJECT.html',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'GPL Cooperation Commitment
Version 1.0

