	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24.000000','FLTK-exception','FLTK exception','http://www.fltk.org/COPYING.php',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'The FLTK library and included programs are provided under the terms of the GNU Library General Public License (LGPL) with the following exceptions:

Modifications to the FLTK configure script, config header file, and makefiles by themselves to support a specific platform do not constitute a modified or derivative work.

The authors do request that such modifications be contributed to the FLTK project - send all contributions to "fltk-bugs@fltk.org".

Widgets that are subclassed from FLTK widgets do not constitute a derivative work.

Static linking of applications and widgets to the FLTK library does not constitute a derivative work and does not require the author to provide source code for the application or widget, use the shared FLTK libraries, or link their applications or widgets against a user-supplied version of FLTK.

If you link the application or widget to a modified version of FLTK, then the changes to FLTK must be provided under the terms of the LGPL in sections 1, 2, and 4.

You do not have to provide a copy of the FLTK license with programs that are linked to the FLTK library, nor do you have to identify the FLTK license in your program or documentation as required by section 6 of the LGPL.

However, programs must still identify their use of FLTK. The following example statement can be included in user documentation to satisfy this requirement:

[program/widget] is based in part on the work of the FLTK project (http://www.fltk.org).','FLTK库和包含的程序是根据GNU库通用公共许可证(LGPL)的条款提供的，以下情况除外：

对FLTK配置脚本、配置头文件和Make文件本身的修改以支持特定平台并不构成修改或派生作品。

作者确实要求将这样的修改贡献给Fltk项目--将所有贡献发送到“fltk-bugs@fltk.org”。

从FLTK小部件派生的小部件不构成派生作品。

将应用程序和小工具静态链接到Fltk库并不构成派生作品，也不要求作者提供应用程序或小工具的源代码、使用共享的Fltk库或将其应用程序或小工具链接到用户提供的Fltk版本。

如果您将应用程序或小部件链接到修改后的FLTK版本，则必须根据第1、2和4节中的LGPL条款提供对FLTK的更改。

您不必提供链接到FLTK库的程序的FLTK许可证副本，也不必按照LGPL第6节的要求在您的程序或文档中标识FLTK许可证。

但是，程序仍必须确定其对FLTK的使用。以下示例语句可以包含在用户文档中以满足此要求：

[程序/小部件]部分基于Fltk项目的工作(http://www.fltk.org).','Specified to be associated with LGPL-2.0. On Fedora List as "FLTK License".'),
	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24.000000','Fawkes-Runtime-exception','Fawkes Runtime Exception','http://www.fawkesrobotics.org/about/license/',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'Linking this library statically or dynamically with other modules is making a combined work based on this library. Thus, the terms and conditions of the GNU General Public License cover the whole combination. As a special exception, the copyright holders of this library give you permission to link this library with independent modules to produce an executable, regardless of the license terms of these independent modules, and to copy and distribute the resulting executable under terms of your choice, provided that you also meet, for each linked independent module, the terms and conditions of the license of that module. An independent module is a module which is not derived from or based on this library. If you modify this library, you may extend this exception to your version of the library, but you are not obligated to do so. If you do not wish to do so, delete this exception statement from your version. Additionally if other files instantiate templates or use macros or inline functions from this file, or you compile this file and link it with other files to produce an executable, this file does not by itself cause the resulting executable to be covered by the GNU General Public License. This exception does not however invalidate any other reasons why the executable file might be covered by the GNU General Public License.','将这个库静态或动态地与其他模块链接起来，就是在这个库的基础上进行组合。因此，GNU通用公共许可证的条款和条件涵盖了整个组合。作为特殊例外，此库的版权所有者允许您将此库与独立模块链接以生成可执行文件，而不管这些独立模块的许可条款是什么，并根据您选择的条款复制和分发生成的可执行文件，前提是您还满足每个链接的独立模块的许可条款和条件。独立模块是指不是从该库派生的模块，也不是基于该库的模块。如果修改此库，您可以将此例外扩展到您的库版本，但您没有义务这样做。如果您不希望这样做，请从您的版本中删除此例外声明。此外，如果其他文件实例化模板或使用此文件中的宏或内联函数，或者您编译此文件并将其与其他文件链接以生成可执行文件，则此文件本身不会导致生成的可执行文件包含在GNU通用公共许可证范围内。但是，此例外不会使GNU通用公共许可证可能涵盖可执行文件的任何其他原因无效。','Combines the Classpath exception with the Macros and Inline Functions exception.'),
	 ('2023-05-11 23:28:24.000000','LLVM-exception','LLVM Exception','http://llvm.org/foundation/relicensing/LICENSE.txt',0,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,'---- LLVM Exceptions to the Apache 2.0 License ----

